{"type":"message","id":"474e778b","parentId":"7d01dfb6","timestamp":"2026-04-30T16:35:45.804Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n\n1. Create a simple scientific calculator app\n2. Deploy it on Vercel\n\nI'll choose the tech stack - I'll go with a pure HTML/CSS/JS approach. It's the simplest, fastest to deploy, and doesn't need any build step. For Vercel deployment, I can use the Vercel CLI or just create the files and use the Vercel platform.\n\nLet me think about the approach:\n\n1. Create the calculator as a single HTML file with embedded CSS and JS (or separate files)\n2. Deploy to Vercel\n\nFor Vercel, the simplest approach is:\n- Create a folder with the project\n- Use `vercel` CLI to deploy\n- Or I can check if the user has Vercel CLI installed\n\nLet me first check if Vercel CLI is available, and create the calculator app.\n\nLet me create a scientific calculator with:\n- Basic operations: +, -, ×, ÷\n- Scientific functions: sin, cos, tan, log, ln, sqrt, power, factorial, pi, e, parentheses\n- Memory functions\n- Clean UI\n\nI'll do this step by step:\n\n1. Create project folder\n2. Create the HTML file\n3. Check if Vercel CLI is installed\n4. Deploy\n\nLet me start by creating the project.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Let's go! Creo una calcolatrice scientifica in **HTML/CSS/JS puro** — zero dipendenze, deploy immediato su Vercel."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_3Ph1WXmkU1Wg7AstpzvV93LL","name":"session_status","arguments":{}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":28,"output":347,"cacheRead":13440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13815,"cost":{"input":0.000003920000000000001,"output":0.00009716000000000001,"cacheRead":0.00037632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0004774}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777566939918,"responseId":"722db9b4-81f3-4fcc-b602-233ced781b6c"}}
